\(M,\\Sigma,\\theta\\in V\\)</span> (mouse code, selected strategy, and strategy-length bound)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec E\">\\(\\vec E\\)</span> (extender-sequence witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3MousePremouse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3MousePremouse}_S\\)</span> (fully iterable mouse predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"203f765d44ea3c39\" href=\"?note=203f765d44ea3c39\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner3-mouse-premouse.md\">58-df-zfc-inner3-mouse-premouse.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}\">\\(\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}\\)</span> (strategy predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0134626c9734e3cd\" href=\"?note=0134626c9734e3cd\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7HullCondensation}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7HullCondensation}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (fine-structural hull-condensation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dfcd8a7128928cfb\" href=\"?note=dfcd8a7128928cfb\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2HodMouse}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner2HodMouse}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}hod\\text{-}mouse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2HodMouse}_S(M,\\Sigma,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\vec E,L,\\operatorname{Hull},\\mathcal B,\\trianglelefteq\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3MousePremouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\n\\land\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}(\\Sigma,M,\\theta)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7HullCondensation}_S\n(M,L,\\operatorname{Hull},\\mathcal B,\\trianglelefteq)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}hod\\text{-}mouse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2HodMouse}_S(M,\\Sigma,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\vec E,L,\\operatorname{Hull},\\mathcal B,\\trianglelefteq\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3MousePremouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\n\\land\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}(\\Sigma,M,\\theta)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7HullCondensation}_S\n(M,L,\\operatorname{Hull},\\mathcal B,\\trianglelefteq)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The supplied <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> itself must be a strategy for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>; an unrelated existential iterability witness is insufficient.</li>\n<li>Full mouse iterability, the selected bounded strategy, and fine-structural condensation are separate typed requirements.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md","status":"resolved","id":"0134626c9734e3cd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation.md","status":"resolved","id":"dfcd8a7128928cfb","anchor":"ref-3","target